description	"Gallius Rax

A shadowy operative who deals in information.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Counselor's Sidearm (1)
-- DC Carbine
-- 160% slower RoF
-- 160% higher damage/FP drain
-- 20% Less Velocity
-- Low Clipsize
-- 40% Slower Mag Reload
- Sabotage Explosive Charge (6)
-- Detpack
-- 100% More Damage
-- Knocks Down On Hit
-- Expanded splash radius
- Trip Mines (4)
-- Sonic Effect/Tracking On Hit
- Concussion Grenades (2)
-- Cripples/Poisons On Hit

^8Attributes:
- Discipline (Anti-MT 2)
- Blast Armor
- Healing (1)
- Contingency Intel (Tracking Beacon)
- Ghost Protocol (Immune to Force Seeing)
- Advanced Slicing (20% faster hack rate)
- Knockdown Roll
- Rally
- Sentry Turret
- Defensive Seeker Drone

^3Abilities:
- Armor Dispenser (2) ^3[USE In Melee]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Cloaking Device (2) ^3[CS2]
- Stimpack ^3[CS3]
- Enemy Scanner ^3[CS4]"
